    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/4dc3b8e403dd0d8768be2cc3cdac030d.avif?t=1729019772\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729019772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>An immersive experience made for you to rescue your tranquility, be inspired, relax and have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c4dbc52223ac7c5676b3941df19a2351.poster.avif?t=1729019772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c4dbc52223ac7c5676b3941df19a2351.webm?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>With the help of VR, we've perfected the immersion and relaxation experience of the first game!<br><br>Enter a world where stress will be left out! In an immersive and relaxing environment, forget about your worries by enchanting yourself and solving the puzzles and enjoy observing the power of life in nature!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/f64d7582634d7493ad214018eb1b05f1.avif?t=1729019772\" /></div><br><br>So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving the 20 puzzles, the complete art of each of them will be released, so at any time you can have fun again solving the entire puzzle.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Gif01.gif\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" /></div>[/img]\n\nSurprise yourself with the minimalist style and the beautiful art of this game, immerse yourself in this world where stress will be left out!\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" webp=\"<br>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Gif01.gif<br><br>Surprise yourself with the minimalist style and the beautiful art of this game, immerse yourself in this world where stress will be left out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c25f242552f48adbb1ad7a8e3a5a9f51.poster.avif?t=1729019772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c25f242552f48adbb1ad7a8e3a5a9f51.webm?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/4dc3b8e403dd0d8768be2cc3cdac030d.avif?t=1729019772\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729019772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>An immersive experience made for you to rescue your tranquility, be inspired, relax and have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c4dbc52223ac7c5676b3941df19a2351.poster.avif?t=1729019772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/c4dbc52223ac7c5676b3941df19a2351.webm?t=1729019772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>With the help of VR, we've perfected the immersion and relaxation experience of the first game!<br><br>Enter a world where stress will be left out! In an immersive and relaxing environment, forget about your worries by enchanting yourself and solving the puzzles and enjoy observing the power of life in nature!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063450/extras/f64d7582634d7493ad214018eb1b05f1.avif?t=1729019772\" /></div><br><br>So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving the 20 puzzles, 